@startuml
title EduCore C4 L3 - Core API components
left to right direction
rectangle "Gateway verified context" as G
package "Core API" {
  rectangle "Tenant resolver\nclaim + host match" as Tenant
  rectangle "Course module" as Course
  rectangle "Exam receipt module\nidempotency + sequence" as Exam
  rectangle "Grading config module\nversioned JSON" as Grade
  rectangle "Plugin registry / dispatcher" as Registry
  rectangle "Audit adapter" as Audit
}
database "Tenant DB selected by role" as DB
rectangle "Plugin process" as Plugin
G --> Tenant : trusted context
Tenant --> Course : scoped request
Tenant --> Exam : scoped request
Tenant --> Grade : scoped request
Tenant --> Registry : scoped request
Exam --> DB : SQL transaction
Grade --> DB : SQL config/read
Registry --> DB : SQL enablement
Registry --> Plugin : HTTP JSON
Tenant --> Audit : denied access event
legend bottom
  C4 L3: components inside Core API.
  All DB calls use tenant-scoped credential from resolver.
  Solid arrows are synchronous; exam worker is shown in L2.
endlegend
@enduml
